      "displayName": "Harshakumar Ummerpillai",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Ab97337af-3737-473c-9779-44d498499536",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A4cbd1cac-35ff-460e-a296-7f84d2cbc967\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"557058:4cbd1cac-35ff-460e-a296-7f84d2cbc967\" data-account-id=\"557058:4cbd1cac-35ff-460e-a296-7f84d2cbc967\" accountid=\"557058:4cbd1cac-35ff-460e-a296-7f84d2cbc967\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Peter Matthew Eichman</a>, we are also having some problems with the transaction manager when doing bulk loads, can you please let us know how to disable fcrepo-audit, is it enabled by default?</p>",
     "created": "10/Nov/17 8:35 AM",
     "id": "19552",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/12562/comment/19552",
